# --- .easignore addendum ---
# This file REPLACES .gitignore for EAS uploads (and is the only filter under
# EAS_NO_VCS). Keep it a superset of .gitignore's sensitive entries.
.git

# Agent tooling and scratch dirs. In .gitignore but had drifted out of here,
# so they were being uploaded — verified with `eas build:inspect --stage
# archive`.
.agents/
.argent/
.codex/
.claude/
.expo-code-review/
prompts/
SETUP-TRACING.md

# Triage artifacts the automation generates at runtime. These can carry
# customer crash and feedback content, so they must never reach a builder.
.eas/crash-triage/crash.json
.eas/crash-triage/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/feedback-triage/feedback.json
.eas/feedback-triage/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/feedback-triage/PUBLIC_REPORT.json
.eas/feedback-triage/PUBLIC_PR.json
.eas/agent-work/issue.json
.eas/agent-work/ANALYSIS.md
.eas/agent-work/PUBLIC_FINDINGS.json
.eas/agent-work/sim/
.eas/pr-review/feedback.md
.eas/pr-review/RESPONSE.md
.eas/pr-review/ACTIONS.json
.eas/public-evidence-site/dist/
.eas/crash-triage/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/crash-triage/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/feedback-triage/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/feedback-triage/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/agent-work/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/agent-work/RESCUED_WORK.md
.eas/pr-review/RESCUED_WORK.patch
.eas/pr-review/RESCUED_WORK.md
.github/pr-review/

# Not needed to build the native app, and together ~80% of the archive.
# docs/design alone is 6.1M of design exports; web/ is the standalone
# euxy-web marketing package (no workspaces, unreferenced from src/).
docs/
web/
